            "review_text": "Nguyên N\n1 contribution\n0\nDelicious Roast Duck Rice\nMar 2025 • Friends\nI recently tried the roast duck rice at a local restaurant after discovering it on TripAdvisor, and I was really impressed, I was so impressed that I went back for a second visit during my 4-day trip. The duck had crispy skin and tender, with just the right amount of flavor. The portion size was generous but not overwhelming, and the staff were friendly and attentive. Overall, it’s a great choice for anyone craving a flavorful and satisfying meal.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 16, 2025",
