            "review_text": "Meo L\n4 contributions\n0\nDelicious roast duck, affordable price, warm service! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nFeb 2025 • Family\nDelicious roast duck, affordable price, warm service! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nThis Nhị Ký Quán roast duck restaurant is really recommended! 🐥🔥 Roast duck skins are crisp and tender, aroma-filled, mouth-to-mouth and taste very authentic. In addition to roast duck, the other dishes were delicious, and the heart of the store was felt in every dish.\n\nðŸ�‍♂️ On the service side: the staff is very warm, attentive and friendly, giving people a feeling of home. The food is also served quickly, allowing people to enjoy the food without waiting long.\n\n💰 In terms of price: super affordable! Very good value for money, where you can enjoy authentic food at a very reasonable price. The only small drawback is that business is too good, roast duck quickly sold out, sometimes go late and can't eat, I hope the store can prepare more in the future, so that more diners can taste this delicious!\n\nOverall, it's a restaurant worth a visit, and friends who love roast duck can't miss it!👏👏👏👏\nRead more\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten March 12, 2025",
